# Only what the image needs. Without this the context is the whole deploy
# directory, CloudFormation templates included.
#
# `!demo-book` alone is NOT enough. `*` excludes every root entry, and
# re-including a directory does not re-include its children — the first build
# shipped an empty /opt/demo-book, the container started fine, and the demo
# served a blank ledger. The `/**` is what carries the contents.
*
!ratio
!entrypoint.sh
!demo-book
!demo-book/**
